SUMMARY:Live Music at ATC
DESCRIPTION:Live at Bay 7 is teaming up with American Tobacco Campus to bring you free live music on Friday nights this summer from a range of local artists and styles\, including jazz\, bluegrass\, rock and more. \nWe’ll set up near the water tower\, so feel free to bring blankets and lawn chairs\, get something to eat and drink from any of our restaurants\, and enjoy\nlive jazz under a setting sun. \nCheck americantobacco.co/events for the most updated schedule of performers.
