SUMMARY:Drag Bingo
DESCRIPTION:Slay your Friday with Drag Bingo right here at Glass Jug Downtown! \nIt’s the most fabulous way to kick off your weekend on the final Friday of every month from 7:00 to 9:00pm. This 18+ free event promises to be amazing – and you can win prizes! \nYour host for the evening will be the incomparable\, gorgeous Drag Queen Seanica. Bull City’s Bearded Babe will guide you through the game AND perform twice for you. That’s right\, Seanica will be blessing the floor with not one but two exciting\, sexy and fun performances. Expect stunning looks\, sharp wit\, and unmatchable energy guiding you through the night. \nForget boring old numbers – we are playing 6 games of Bingo featuring iconic drag terms instead! Listen closely to Seanica\, match the terms on your card\, and you could walk away a winner. We’re handing out awesome prizes for every single round so stay till the end for the show and the chance to win. \nWe’ll be serving our tasty summer cocktails\, frozen drinks\, and a rotating selection of our award-winning craft beers to satiate your thirst as you play. Come out early to snag a spot\, grab a cold drink from the bar\, and let the games begin! \nView on Facebook.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/drag-bingo/2026-07-31/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Drag-Bingo.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Glass Jug Downtown Durham":MAILTO:info@glass-jug.com
GEO:36.0014902;-78.9018252
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Glass Jug Downtown 545 Foster Street Suite 10 Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=545 Foster Street\, Suite 10:geo:-78.9018252,36.0014902
END:VEVENT
