SUMMARY:Tease in the Seas - Burlesque and Drag Show - Durham
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a night of fabulous flair and unforgettable performances at the “”Tease in the Seas – Burlesque and Drag Show – Durham”” at The Pinhook! This vibrant venue in the heart of Durham\, North Carolina\, sets the perfect stage for an evening filled with dazzling costumes\, mesmerizing choreography\, and a celebration of self-expression. Join us as talented performers bring their unique artistry to life\, creating an electric atmosphere that will leave you breathless and wanting more. \nWhether you’re a seasoned burlesque enthusiast or new to the scene\, this show promises to captivate and entertain. With a lineup that showcases the best of drag and burlesque talent\, you’re in for a treat! Don’t miss out on this enchanting experience—gather your friends and secure your tickets now for “”Tease in the Seas – Burlesque and Drag Show – Durham”” at The Pinhook!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/tease-in-the-seas-burlesque-and-drag-show-durham/
LOCATION:The Pinhook\, 117 W Main St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Tease-in-the-Seas-Burlesque-and-Drag-Show.jpg
