SUMMARY:Mixed Level Stained Glass: Incense Holders Beginners Welcome!
DESCRIPTION:This is a three-hour class in which students will learn the basics of the copper foil or “Tiffany” method of creating stained glass. This process includes cutting\, grinding\, foiling\, and soldering individual glass pieces. Students will select one project from our incense holder template selection and take home a finished piece the same day. All materials are included in class pricing. \nNo prior glass experience necessary. \nPlease wear closed-toe shoes and bring something with sleeves
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/mixed-level-stained-glass-incense-holders-beginners-welcome/
