SUMMARY:Downtown Durham True Crime Walking Tour
DESCRIPTION:From mayoral candidates turned murder suspects\, to terrifying cult leaders\, to dramatic gangster dramas. Join us on the guided Durham True Crime Tour\, hosted by a local historian\, and explore the dark side of Durham’s history.
