SUMMARY:Fiesta Latina
DESCRIPTION:The vibrant spirit of Latino culture will come alive at the annual Durham Fiesta Latina in Durham\, presented by the City of Durham Parks & Recreation in partnership with El Centro Hispano. The Durham Fiesta Latina in Durham is a joyful celebration of the rich and diverse Latino culture. Attendees will have the opportunity to experience authentic cuisine\, lively music\, folkloric dancing\, and engaging activities that are fun for the entire family. In addition to the festivities\, the event will also provide valuable information and resources to support the Latino community. For additional information visit El Centro Hispana’s website: https://elcentronc.org/durham-latino-festival/.
